        <span class="front"><span class="q">“Adults can get type 1 too.”</span><span class="tap">Tap to flip</span></span>
        <span class="back"><span class="verdict true">True.</span><span class="a">It often starts in childhood, but it can begin at any age. Many people are diagnosed as adults.</span><span class="tap">“Adults can get type 1 too.”</span></span>
