  <section class="closing">
    <p class="big">People with type 1 go to school, run marathons, raise families and do every job you can think of.</p>
    <p class="prose" style="color: var(--muted);">They just do it while quietly doing the work of a pancreas. A little understanding from the people around them goes a long way.</p>
